            <p>
              Wei You is an assistant professor of <a href="https://ieda.ust.hk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Industrial Engineering and Decision Analytics</a>
              at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology. His research focuses on stochastic models, queueing theory,
